            <sortOrder>1</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>3. If the user&apos;s message contains words like &quot;critical&quot;, &quot;urgent&quot;, &quot;emergency&quot;,   or &quot;immediate&quot;, acknowledge that the delay will be flagged as critical.</description>
            <developerName>instructions_1_1771379034578</developerName>
            <language>en_US</language>
            <masterLabel>instructions_1_1771379034578</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>2</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>4. Summarise what you are about to log and ask for confirmation:
   &quot;I&apos;ll log a work delay against [Work Order]. Here&apos;s what I have:
