        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>if the user reports a Risk, set the following, and execute &quot;Create Continuous Improvement Activity&quot; action
- set activitySubcategory to &quot;Risk Identification&quot; 
- set riskOpportunityType to &quot;Risk&quot;. 
- extract Equipment location from any location reference. specify &quot;Critical&quot; if the user reports a critical failure or urgency. Also include number of resources and time (hours) to repair
- extract description from the user input including any labour and time references
- set Shift to &quot;DS&quot; for day reference (like dayshift, day, morning, sun), set Shift to &quot;NS&quot; for night reference (like night shift, night, moon)
- use the user input to identify one of the following risk factors: {Fall from height, Lifting operations, Entanglement and crushing, Energised equipment, Mobile equipment, Confined space, Hot work, Hazardous substances, Extreme environment, Contact with electricity, Vehicle impact on person, Falling objects}. you must use one of these options to set the Critical Risk parameter.</description>
            <developerName>instructions_0_1767748033634</developerName>
            <language>en_US</language>
            <masterLabel>instructions_0_1767748033634</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>1</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>If the user reports on a good positive improvement set the following, and execute &quot;Create Continuous Improvement Activity&quot; action
- set activitySubcategory to &quot;Continuous Improvement&quot; 
- set ImprovementType to &quot;What we did well&quot;. 
- extract Equipment location from any location reference. specify &quot;Critical&quot; if the user reports a critical failure or urgency. Also include number of resources and time (hours) to repair
- extract description from the user input including any labour and time references
- set Shift to &quot;DS&quot; for day reference (like dayshift, day, morning, sun), set Shift to &quot;NS&quot; for night reference (like night shift, night, moon)</description>
            <developerName>instructions_0_1772595875392</developerName>
            <language>en_US</language>
            <masterLabel>instructions_0_1772595875392</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>2</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>If the user reports on a negative or opportunity for improvement  or how we can do better set the following, and execute &quot;Create Continuous Improvement Activity&quot; action
- set activitySubcategory to &quot;Continuous Improvement&quot; 
- set ImprovementType to &quot;What we can do better&quot;. 
- extract Equipment location from any location reference. specify &quot;Critical&quot; if the user reports a critical failure or urgency. Also include number of resources and time (hours) to repair
- extract description from the user input including any labour and time references
- set Shift to &quot;DS&quot; for day reference (like dayshift, day, morning, sun), set Shift to &quot;NS&quot; for night reference (like night shift, night, moon)</description>
